{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_3F02D27A","title":"Rosco 3","entry":"Dlg_3F02D27A::entry","exit":"Dlg_3F02D27A::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F83E7C9F","articyId":"72057752951736059","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Madness.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Madness.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":375.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45058","byteOffset":31379496,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_473CEA63","articyId":"72057752951736073","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Worse. Something vanished.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Worse. Something vanished.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25816","byteOffset":17649312,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_15964778","articyId":"72057752951736086","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Thought of that. But the Carto Carry still shows the data. It insists there should be a stairwell there. But when I try to re-scan, it won’t let me overwrite the old map. Like it’s… arguing with itself.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thought of that. But the Carto Carry still shows the data. It insists there should be a stairwell there. But when I try to re-scan, it won’t let me overwrite the old map. Like it’s… arguing with itself.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26391","byteOffset":17865784,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_0B5C2FDE","articyId":"72057752951736100","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Yeah. There was this little stairwell behind an old shoe shop in Lowtown. I mapped it last week—nothing special. Went back today? Gone. Not demolished. No trace. Just… never existed.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. There was this little stairwell behind an old shoe shop in Lowtown. I mapped it last week—nothing special. Went back today? Gone. Not demolished. No trace. Just… never existed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42104","byteOffset":30254904,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_9A93DAA3","articyId":"72057752951736115","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Get this—I asked a guy who works at the shop if he noticed anything weird. He just stared at me like I was speaking a dead language. Told me there’s never been a stairwell there. Never.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Get this—I asked a guy who works at the shop if he noticed anything weird. He just stared at me like I was speaking a dead language. Told me there’s never been a stairwell there. Never.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22004","byteOffset":16211336,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_D0691537","articyId":"72057752951736129","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"I really hope so. That's the best case scenario.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I really hope so. That's the best case scenario.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3575.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38095","byteOffset":28746600,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_68E61B7E","articyId":"72057752951736143","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Because if the city is losing it, we’ve got way bigger problems than my bad memory.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because if the city is losing it, we’ve got way bigger problems than my bad memory.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41414","byteOffset":29995416,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_E6B97F51","articyId":"72057752951736194","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"I really hope I'm just losing my mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I really hope I'm just losing my mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3575.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41035","byteOffset":29852848,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_BDCDA427","articyId":"72057821671324509","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Never drank in my life. Couldn't afford it.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Never drank in my life. Couldn't afford it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45851","b